title: Wybory Prezydenta Rzeczypospolitej
new-page: true
call: polish_opening_state
on-arrival: {!
// This mandatory December sequence is resumable and never advances the month.
// Its 111-seat Senate is only a proportional National Assembly snapshot, not a
// general Senate simulation. Fixed historical ballots are not calculated from
// that simplified composition.
if (Q.polish_presidential_system && Q.polish_presidential_due &&
        !Q.polish_presidential_pending && !Q.polish_presidential_sequence_completed) {
    function copy(value) { return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(value)); }
    function compareId(a, b) { return a < b ? -1 : a > b ? 1 : 0; }
    var senateTotal = 111;
    var sejm = Q.sejm_parliament;
    var senateSeats = {};
    var assemblySeats = {};
    var assigned = 0;
    var remainders = Q.parties.map(function(party) {
        var exact = senateTotal * (sejm.party_seats[party] || 0) / sejm.total_seats;
        var seats = Math.floor(exact);
        senateSeats[party] = seats;
        assigned += seats;
        return {party: party, remainder: exact - seats};
    });
    remainders.sort(function(a, b) {
        return b.remainder - a.remainder || compareId(a.party, b.party);
    });
    for (var index = 0; index < senateTotal - assigned; index++) {
        senateSeats[remainders[index].party] += 1;
    }
    for (var party of Q.parties) {
        assemblySeats[party] = (sejm.party_seats[party] || 0) + senateSeats[party];
    }
    var assembly = {
        id: 'national_assembly_1922_12',
        kind: 'gameplay_proportional_senate_snapshot',
        sejm_total: sejm.total_seats,
        senate_total: senateTotal,
        total_members: sejm.total_seats + senateTotal,
        sejm_seats: copy(sejm.party_seats),
        senate_seats: senateSeats,
        party_seats: assemblySeats,
        party_names: copy(Q.party_names)
    };
    Q.polish_presidency.assembly = copy(assembly);
    Q.polish_presidential_pending = {
        id: 'presidential_december_1922',
        phase: 'first_nomination',
        assembly: copy(assembly),
        first_pps_candidate: null,
        second_pps_candidate: null,
        assassination_response: null
    };
    Q.polish_presidential_phase = 'first_nomination';
}
!}
go-to: first_nomination if polish_presidential_phase = "first_nomination"; first_final if polish_presidential_phase = "first_final"; first_transfer if polish_presidential_phase = "first_transfer"; assassination if polish_presidential_phase = "assassination"; response if polish_presidential_phase = "response"; second_nomination if polish_presidential_phase = "second_nomination"; second_final if polish_presidential_phase = "second_final"; main if polish_presidential_phase = "" or polish_presidential_sequence_completed

@first_nomination
new-page: true
go-to: first_without_daszynski if daszynski_left_adviser_pool

= Zgromadzenie Narodowe — 9 December 1922

The first President of the Republic will be elected by the **National Assembly**: the 444-member Sejm together with an approved 111-seat Senate approximation. The Senate snapshot follows the Sejm party proportions for this sequence only; it is not a complete second-chamber mechanic.

Five candidates enter the historical ballots: **Maurycy Zamoyski** for the right, **Stanisław Wojciechowski** for PSL Piast, **Jan Baudouin de Courtenay** for the national minorities, **Gabriel Narutowicz** for PSL Wyzwolenie, and **Ignacy Daszyński** for PPS.

The game compresses the earlier ballots and displays only the final contest. The result is fixed historically rather than recalculated from the simplified Assembly.

- @confirm_daszynski: Confirm Ignacy Daszyński as the PPS candidate.
- @decline_daszynski: Do not nominate Ignacy Daszyński.

@confirm_daszynski
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.polish_presidential_pending && Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase === 'first_nomination') {
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.first_pps_candidate = 'ignacy_daszynski';
    Q.polish_presidency.pps_decisions.push({
        id: 'first_presidential_nomination_1922', date: '1922-12-09',
        decision: 'nominate_ignacy_daszynski',
        active_adviser_slot_required: false
    });
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase = 'first_final';
    Q.polish_presidential_phase = 'first_final';
}
!}
go-to: first_final

PPS confirms its historical candidate. This candidacy does not remove Daszyński from an active adviser slot and has no numerical support, faction, relationship or resource effect.

@decline_daszynski
choose-if: 1 = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Historical outcome: PPS nominated Daszyński. This alternative is not implemented.
go-to: first_final

@first_without_daszynski
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.polish_presidential_pending && Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase === 'first_nomination') {
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.first_pps_candidate = '';
    Q.polish_presidency.pps_decisions.push({
        id: 'first_presidential_nomination_1922', date: '1922-12-09',
        decision: 'no_pps_candidate_after_daszynski_departure',
        active_adviser_slot_required: false
    });
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase = 'first_final';
    Q.polish_presidential_phase = 'first_final';
}
!}

= PPS has no candidate

Ignacy Daszyński has already left the PPS through the implemented Centrum crisis. His former adviser-slot status is irrelevant, but the party cannot now force him to stand as its candidate. This is an alternate nomination state; the approved presidential result remains fixed.

- @first_final: Continue to the final ballot.

@first_final
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.polish_presidential_pending && Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase === 'first_final') {
    if (!Q.polish_presidency.elections.some(function(election) { return election.id === 'president_1922_12_09'; })) {
        Q.polish_presidency.elections.push({
            id: 'president_1922_12_09', date: '1922-12-09',
            body: 'national_assembly', method: 'fixed_historical_final_ballot',
            assembly_id: Q.polish_presidential_pending.assembly.id,
            pps_candidate: Q.polish_presidential_pending.first_pps_candidate,
            final_ballot: [
                {candidate_id: 'gabriel_narutowicz', candidate_name: 'Gabriel Narutowicz', votes: 289,
                 supporters: ['psl_wyzwolenie', 'pps', 'psl_piast', 'minorities_bloc', 'npr']},
                {candidate_id: 'maurycy_zamoyski', candidate_name: 'Maurycy Zamoyski', votes: 227,
                 supporters: ['zln', 'pschd']}
            ],
            blank_ballots: 29,
            winner_id: 'gabriel_narutowicz', winner_name: 'Gabriel Narutowicz'
        });
    }
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase = 'first_transfer';
    Q.polish_presidential_phase = 'first_transfer';
}
!}

= Final ballot — 9 December 1922

**Gabriel Narutowicz — 289 votes**
Supported by PSL Wyzwolenie, PPS, most of PSL Piast, the Blok Mniejszości Narodowych and part of NPR.

**Maurycy Zamoyski — 227 votes**
Supported by ZLN and PSChD within ChZJN, together with other right-wing parliamentarians.

There are also 29 blank ballots. **Gabriel Narutowicz is elected President of the Republic.** These are fixed historical totals, not a ballot calculated from the game's proportional Senate approximation.

- @first_transfer: Continue to the constitutional transfer.

@first_transfer
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.polish_presidential_pending && Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase === 'first_transfer') {
    if (!Q.polish_presidency.transitions.some(function(item) { return item.id === 'narutowicz_oath'; })) {
        Q.polish_presidency.transitions.push({
            id: 'narutowicz_oath', date: '1922-12-11', kind: 'presidential_oath',
            office_id: 'prezydent_rp', holder_id: 'gabriel_narutowicz', holder_name: 'Gabriel Narutowicz'
        });
        Q.polish_presidency.transitions.push({
            id: 'pilsudski_transfer', date: '1922-12-14', kind: 'transfer_from_naczelnik_panstwa',
            from_holder_id: 'jozef_pilsudski', to_holder_id: 'gabriel_narutowicz'
        });
    }
    Q.polish_presidency.current = {
        office_id: 'prezydent_rp', holder_id: 'gabriel_narutowicz',
        holder_name: 'Gabriel Narutowicz', status: 'incumbent', since: '1922-12-11'
    };
    Q.head_of_state_office = 'prezydent_rp';
    Q.head_of_state_name = 'Gabriel Narutowicz';
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase = 'assassination';
    Q.polish_presidential_phase = 'assassination';
}
!}

= The presidency begins

Gabriel Narutowicz takes the constitutional oath on 11 December. On 14 December, Józef Piłsudski formally transfers state authority to the President, ending the transitional office of Naczelnik Państwa.

The presidency is governed by the March Constitution. Government acts require ministerial countersignature; the President appoints the prime minister and appoints ministers on the prime minister's proposal. The office does not inherit the German president's direct-popular mandate, independent emergency-decree model or legacy game powers.

- @assassination: Continue to 16 December.

@assassination
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.polish_presidential_pending && Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase === 'assassination') {
    if (!Q.polish_presidency.transitions.some(function(item) { return item.id === 'narutowicz_assassinated'; })) {
        Q.polish_presidency.transitions.push({
            id: 'narutowicz_assassinated', date: '1922-12-16', kind: 'assassination',
            holder_id: 'gabriel_narutowicz', holder_name: 'Gabriel Narutowicz'
        });
    }
    // Approved compression: do not simulate the brief acting presidency.
    Q.polish_presidency.current = {
        office_id: 'prezydent_rp', holder_id: '', holder_name: '',
        status: 'succession_compressed', since: '1922-12-16'
    };
    Q.head_of_state_office = 'prezydent_rp';
    Q.head_of_state_name = '';
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase = 'response';
    Q.polish_presidential_phase = 'response';
}
!}
go-to: response

@response
new-page: true

= The assassination of Gabriel Narutowicz

On 16 December, Gabriel Narutowicz is assassinated at the Zachęta gallery by Eligiusz Niewiadomski after a campaign of nationalist hostility against the elected President. The game compresses the short constitutional interregnum and proceeds directly to the PPS response and the second election.

PPS leaders must defend the constitutional order while preventing grief and anger from becoming political retaliation.

- @constitutional_response: Defend democracy through peaceful mobilization and demand lawful accountability.
- @armed_reprisals: Authorize armed reprisals against nationalist leaders and press organizations.

@constitutional_response
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.polish_presidential_pending && Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase === 'response') {
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.assassination_response = 'constitutional_peaceful_mobilization';
    if (!Q.polish_presidency.pps_decisions.some(function(item) { return item.id === 'narutowicz_assassination_response'; })) {
        Q.polish_presidency.pps_decisions.push({
            id: 'narutowicz_assassination_response', date: '1922-12-16',
            decision: 'constitutional_peaceful_mobilization', numerical_effects: false
        });
    }
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase = 'second_nomination';
    Q.polish_presidential_phase = 'second_nomination';
}
!}
go-to: second_nomination

PPS supports peaceful democratic mobilization and lawful accountability. This approved historical choice is recorded without changing support, relationships, faction state, resources, or militia strength and militancy.

@armed_reprisals
choose-if: 1 = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Historical outcome: Daszyński opposed armed political reprisals. This alternative is not implemented.
go-to: second_nomination

@second_nomination
new-page: true

= The second election — 20 December 1922

The National Assembly reconvenes. **Stanisław Wojciechowski**, supported by PSL Piast, faces **Kazimierz Morawski**, the candidate of the right. Only this final ballot is simulated.

- @do_not_run_daszynski_second: Do not run Ignacy Daszyński; support the historical parliamentary outcome.
- @run_daszynski_second: Run Ignacy Daszyński as the PPS candidate.

@do_not_run_daszynski_second
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.polish_presidential_pending && Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase === 'second_nomination') {
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.second_pps_candidate = '';
    Q.polish_presidency.pps_decisions.push({
        id: 'second_presidential_nomination_1922', date: '1922-12-20',
        decision: 'no_pps_candidate_support_historical_outcome',
        active_adviser_slot_required: false
    });
    Q.polish_presidential_pending.phase = 'second_final';
    Q.polish_presidential_phase = 'second_final';
}
!}
go-to: second_final

@run_daszynski_second
choose-if: 1 = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Historical outcome: PPS did not run Daszyński in the second election. This alternative is not implemented.
go-to: second_final

