= Final ballot — 20 December 1922

**Stanisław Wojciechowski — 298 votes**
Supported by PSL Piast, PSL Wyzwolenie, PPS, NPR and the Blok Mniejszości Narodowych.

**Kazimierz Morawski — 221 votes**
Supported by ZLN and PSChD within ChZJN, together with other right-wing parliamentarians.

**Stanisław Wojciechowski is elected and assumes the office of President of the Republic.** The current government and all ten portfolio assignments remain unchanged; successor-cabinet chronology requires a separate researched slice.

- @finish: Resume December play.

@finish
go-to: root

The two approved presidential results and PPS decisions are now part of the permanent game history. No monthly action has been spent.
